1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,616
Someone having a seizure?

2
00:00:01,616 --> 00:00:03,200
Stay calm and stay with them.

3
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:06,095
Most seizures stop on their own within a few minutes.

4
00:00:07,250 --> 00:00:14,290
Keep them safe: move hard or sharp things away, cushion their head, loosen anything tight around the neck, and note the time.

5
00:00:17,250 --> 00:00:20,072
Don't hold them down and never put anything in their mouth.

6
00:00:20,072 --> 00:00:21,602
They can't swallow their tongue.

7
00:00:26,250 --> 00:00:32,671
When the shaking stops, gently roll them onto their side, check their breathing, and stay with them until they're fully awake.

8
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:45,274
Call emergency services if it lasts over 5 minutes, it's their first seizure, another one starts, they're hurt, struggle to breathe, or it happened in water.
